  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have been given the length of focal chord&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4108cf90-11c4-4fed-a4e0-1f68b319ba34.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 243px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>Length of focal chord at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p>Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Since ordinate of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6b7112c9-9d8d-4249-9633-c7bfa13c062e.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 80px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> as slope of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is positive)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Required line<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>111</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>43</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;does not lie on line.</p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
